  "details": "1. Create a script to change VRC URL array and send URLs to other users manually on serialization.\n\n2. It doesn't work because VRC URL arrays are never synced.\n\nI'm creating a world for presenting slide decks loaded through VRC Image Downloader, which requires all players to receive the links. VRC URL is heavily locked-down and prevents the most basic operations from being performed: no string operations like automating prefixes or suffixes or parsing to make loading lists of URLs in sequence very easy, and arrays cannot be synced.\n\nThere are so many hoops to jump through in order to get basic functions operating with VRC URL. If there are security reasons we can't have strings, at least having the array synced would greatly improve systems like this.",
